## Task 1 - Create a Metric View

1. In **Catalog**, navigate to `{{ cat }}` → `default` schema, then click **Create** → **Metric view** in the top right.

    {{ shot('03-uc-semantics/3-2-01-create-metric-view.png', 'Create > Metric view') }}

2. Enter `{{ mv.name }}` in the **Name** field.

    {{ shot('03-uc-semantics/3-2-02-metric-view-name.png', 'Enter Metric View name') }}

3. If the editor opens in UI mode, click the `<>` toggle in the top right to switch to YAML editor. Delete all content and paste the YAML below. Replace `{{ cat }}` ({{ mv.catalog_refs }} places) with your catalog name.

    ```yaml title="{{ mv.name }}"
    --8<-- "lab-files/eng/step3/{{ mv.name }}.yaml"
    ```

    {{ shot('03-uc-semantics/3-2-03-yaml-editor.png', 'Paste YAML') }}

4. Click **Save**. Verify on the **Overview** tab that **Measures** ({{ mv.n_measures }}) and **Fields** ({{ mv.n_fields }}) are registered.

    {{ shot('03-uc-semantics/3-2-04-overview.png', mv.name ~ ' Overview') }}

